  "instructions": [
    "Combine the rice, water, and 1/2 tsp salt in a medium saucepan. Bring to a boil, then cover and reduce the heat to low.",
    "Cook the rice for 15 minutes, until the water is absorbed and the grains are tender. Keep it covered off the heat until serving.",
    "Heat the oil in a 12 inch skillet over medium-high heat. Add the ground beef and break it into small crumbles.",
    "Cook for 6 to 7 minutes, stirring now and then, until no pink remains and the beef reaches 160 F.",
    "Add the garlic and ground ginger. Stir for 30 seconds, until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the coconut aminos, maple syrup, and pepper. Simmer for 2 to 3 minutes, until the sauce thickens and coats the beef.",
    "Fluff the rice and divide it among 4 bowls. Spoon the beef over the rice.",
    "Top each bowl with cucumber, grated carrots, and scallions. Serve warm."
  ],
